            <h2 class="mb-5 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl font-montserrat">
              Built on <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-amber-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">trust</span> &amp; quality
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:text-xl">
              JULIEKA is committed to delivering quality products and exceptional service. We focus on reliability,
              customer satisfaction, and continuous improvement—so every order feels as good as the last.
            </p>
            <div class="mb-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
              <div class="card-lift rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-orange-50/40 p-4 text-center">
                <div class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-500 text-white shadow-md shadow-orange-200">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-award text-lg"></i>
                </div>
                <p class="font-montserrat text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Quality first</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">Carefully sourced items</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-lift rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-orange-50/40 p-4 text-center">
                <div class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-500 text-white shadow-md shadow-orange-200">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-lg"></i>
                </div>
                <p class="font-montserrat text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">You matter</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">Support that listens</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-lift rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-orange-50/40 p-4 text-center sm:col-span-1">
                <div class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-500 text-white shadow-md shadow-orange-200">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up text-lg"></i>
                </div>
                <p class="font-montserrat text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Always improving</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">Better every day</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="{{ path('app_about') }}" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600 px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-300/40 transition hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-orange-700 hover:shadow-xl">
              Learn more about us
