            Discover our <span class="text-orange-600">products</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600 md:text-xl">
            Browse the full collection in your dashboard. When you are ready to order, we will ask you to sign in—quick, simple, and secure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="card-lift rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-md">
            <div class="product-feature-icon mb-4 inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-2xl text-orange-600"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 font-montserrat text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Curated catalog</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Explore categories and find items picked for quality and value.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-lift rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-md">
            <div class="product-feature-icon mb-4 inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-2xl text-orange-600"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 font-montserrat text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Secure checkout</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Log in when you order so your details stay protected.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-lift rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-md">
