              “Amazing products and super fast delivery. Highly recommended!”
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-orange-100/80 pt-5">
              <img src="{{ asset('img/Julieka.jpg') }}" alt="" class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover ring-4 ring-orange-100" width="56" height="56">
              <div>
                <p class="font-montserrat font-bold text-gray-900">Ana Reyes</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Verified customer</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card-lift relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-orange-50/30 p-6 shadow-md md:p-8">
            <div class="absolute right-4 top-4 text-5xl text-orange-500/15">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-right"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4 flex gap-0.5 star-gold">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-sm"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-sm"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-sm"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-sm"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-sm"></i>
