                  <i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-montserrat font-bold text-gray-900">Timely replies</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We aim to get back to you without keeping you waiting.</p>
